      "q_source": "stage2_test_predictions.csv",
      "step_number": 6,
      "text": "Step 6: When $a = b = c$, the expression becomes $\\frac{c}{a} + \\frac{a}{b+c} + \\frac{b}{c} = 1 + \\frac{1}{2} + 1 = \\frac{5}{2}$.",
      "z": 4.124669547917995
