      "text": "Step 8: Consider the expression $\\frac{c}{a} + \\frac{a}{b+c} + \\frac{b}{c} - \\frac{5}{2}$. We want to show this can be made arbitrarily small or even negative by choosing appropriate values of $a$, $b$, and $c$.",
